questions.explanation:
(A) \(Pb_{3}O_{4}\) is insoluble in water or does not react with water.
2KO_{2} + 2H_{2}O \to 2KOH + H_{2}O_{2} + O_{2(g)} \uparrow
Na_{2}O_{2} + 2H_{2}O \to 2NaOH + H_{2}O_{2}
Li_{2}O_{2} + 2H_{2}O \to 2LiOH + H_{2}O_{2}
Only \(KO_{2}\) (potassium superoxide) liberates \(O_{2}\) upon hydrolysis.
